<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Fraser commenting as private citizen-Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Fraser commenting as private citizen-Costello.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Wednesday former Reserve Bank of Australia governor Bernie Fraser's interest rate comments on Tuesday were those of a private citizen.</p>
</text>
